 "notes": "Good calendar: a single public Google Calendar (machine-readable iCal feed) with places and contact department for nearly every item. Individual calendar entries have no web pages, so the calendar page is cited as the source. Holidays, seasons, personal entries and one cancelled 'Low Country' entry were left out. The weekly conference prayer line (Mondays, since 2016) and the monthly 'CC Offering Focus' emphases are listed once each. Nosoca Pines Ranch is the hub (retreats, councils, outdoor education, workshops). Paired English/Hispanic programming is built into the calendar (women's retreats, Romance at the Ranch marriage retreats), and a Hispanic Children's Ministry track runs zone trainings, a children's evangelistic campaign and a juniors retreat. Evangelism: Evangelism IMPACT convention (1-4 Jan 2026, all departments; 'New Evangelism Impact' held for 21 Nov 2026), ACTS church-planting trainings and the GROW Carolina 2027 evangelism plan. Camp meeting is at Lake Junaluska (24-30 May 2026) with a separate Hispanic Convention at Ridgecrest. Hurricane Helene recovery work with community partners continued into 2026 (Polk County, NC)."
